    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>Death Unphased Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/5a1bf704364d34a6dc4da595fa9a4735.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discuss strategies and solutions for the levels, ask questions, or give feedback in Discord!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/fd774fd68dfccb586aac097a6daad6a1.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Unphased is a challenging precision platformer where you phase through walls, spikes, and enemies with your dash. A short arcade-like experience with the goal of beating your fastest time in each level. Flex your puzzle-solving and speedrunning abilities as you forge the best path to the exit door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death doesn't scare you. It energizes you. Phase through anything that would normally kill you and gain an extra mid-air dash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment - there's always another solution, but it may not be obvious. Cut around the unphaseable acid spikes? Wall jump first for a good angle to chain together dashes? Reposition an enemy for an ideal route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hints. Just your brain, your controller, and the ability to phase dash. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/6a7e9f0974236104b6668d64228bb8a0.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phase dash</strong> - Walls and platforms can no longer stop you. Choose how to utilize your dash to make it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dangerous speed</strong> - Phasing through an enemy or dangerous object grants you an extra mid-air dash. Chain together dashes to avoid death and blaze past barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tricky navigation</strong> - Disappearing dash platforms, hovering ghosts, directional push arrows, and more will lay between you and the exit. Observe, learn, and experiment. Think carefully how to maneuver through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level timer</strong> - The timer saves the fastest time you've achieved on each level. There is no online leaderboard. The focus is on you to figure out the fastest route and improve on your best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level ranks</strong> - Aim for the S, A, B, or C rank on a level based on completion time! Speedrunners can hunt for the S rank times or even the secret Z rank times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customization</strong> - Remappable controls (for controller and keyboard), screenshake disable, and shadow removal allow you to enjoy the experience your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a4ab53dc95a496ef0a847415ee8b22db.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/fd774fd68dfccb586aac097a6daad6a1.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death Unphased is a challenging precision platformer where you phase through walls, spikes, and enemies with your dash. A short arcade-like experience with the goal of beating your fastest time in each level. Flex your puzzle-solving and speedrunning abilities as you forge the best path to the exit door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a6ad7aa470c31dc5d1bc4577d114ce23.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death doesn't scare you. It energizes you. Phase through anything that would normally kill you and gain an extra mid-air dash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/536eaa0713afd454cf020bb1100d6c6b.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experiment - there's always another solution, but it may not be obvious. Cut around the unphaseable acid spikes? Wall jump first for a good angle to chain together dashes? Reposition an enemy for an ideal route?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.poster.avif?t=1729946868\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.webm?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/0efb09af9a70334eae5efb33bf3ffc7e.mp4?t=1729946868\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No hints. Just your brain, your controller, and the ability to phase dash. Will you rise to the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/6a7e9f0974236104b6668d64228bb8a0.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Phase dash</strong> - Walls and platforms can no longer stop you. Choose how to utilize your dash to make it to the end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dangerous speed</strong> - Phasing through an enemy or dangerous object grants you an extra mid-air dash. Chain together dashes to avoid death and blaze past barriers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tricky navigation</strong> - Disappearing dash platforms, hovering ghosts, directional push arrows, and more will lay between you and the exit. Observe, learn, and experiment. Think carefully how to maneuver through the levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level timer</strong> - The timer saves the fastest time you've achieved on each level. There is no online leaderboard. The focus is on you to figure out the fastest route and improve on your best time!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Level ranks</strong> - Aim for the S, A, B, or C rank on a level based on completion time! Speedrunners can hunt for the S rank times or even the secret Z rank times.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customization</strong> - Remappable controls (for controller and keyboard), screenshake disable, and shadow removal allow you to enjoy the experience your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2198590/extras/a4ab53dc95a496ef0a847415ee8b22db.avif?t=1729946868\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "Invent your own path! Phase through walls with your dash and blaze towards the exit. Death Unphased is a short experience fusing precision and puzzle platforming. Speedrun the smartest routes and aim to beat your fastest time in each level.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cIf you're a fan of the precision platformer genre or are looking for a game to spend hours grinding for the best time possible, Death Unphased is going to be a great title for you to pick up.\u201d<br>GameGrin<br><br>\u201c...Death Unphased is exactly what you think it is, and it is a brilliant example of the genre.\u201d<br>Gert Lush Gaming<br><br>\u201cDeath Unphased has mad flow.\u201d<br>LumosJared<br>",
